GENERATE 10

TRANSFER .1,TYPEB,TYPEA

TYPEA QUEUE QA
SEIZE INSPA
DEPART QA
ADVANCE 6,2
TRANSFER .1,REJA,ACCA

ACCA RELEASE INSPA
TERMINATE 1

REJA RELEASE INSPA
TERMINATE 1


TYPEB QUEUE QB
SEIZE INSPB
DEPART QB
ADVANCE 10,2
TRANSFER .1,REJB,ACCB

ACCB RELEASE INSPB
TERMINATE 1

REJB RELEASE INSPB
TERMINATE 1

INSPA STORAGE 1
INSPB STORAGE 1
START 1000
END